
The macOS GPUIOverlayView event-registration pattern and deferred scene-plane
architecture in this change were adapted from the Apache-2.0 GPUI crates in
https://github.com/egoist/zed at 57bd4fe181639797d395978d5de17bc9e10a6219.
The overlay input policy, Metal integration and lifecycle adaptations are Zeron
changes.

`crates/gpui/src/bounds_tree.rs` (a balanced tree, and last frame's orderings
replayed while bounds repeat), the per-size native font in
`crates/gpui_macos/src/text_system.rs`, and grouping sprites by texture in
`crates/gpui/src/scene.rs` are adapted from the Apache-2.0 GPUI fork
https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-fast at 8eed010 (bounds tree), a9a9533
(fonts) and ceb4795 (sprites).

`crates/gpui/src/path_cache.rs` (tessellated path shapes kept from one build
to the next, at most 2048 shapes and 16 MiB a thread) and its hook in
`PathBuilder::build` (`crates/gpui/src/path_builder.rs`) are adapted from the
same fork at f0572b0 (`crates/gpui/src/fast/path_cache.rs` and its tests).
